==> artifacts/rb/issue.md <==
# Reconnect dropped Modbus clients

## Goal
A client tab reconnects on its own after the server drops the connection.
Today the user restarts the tab by hand.
==> artifacts/rb/spec-diff.md <==
# rb — spec diff (rev 1)

## Summary
Goal: A client tab reconnects on its own after the server drops the connection.

## S1 — Server restarts during polling
Given a client tab polling a TCP server
When the server closes the connection
Then the tab shows "reconnecting" and polling resumes once the server is back

## MB-E-001 — new · edge-cases `## Client`
Slow server — poll skipped

## MB-R-001 — changed · requirements `## Client`
The client connects over TCP.

## MB-R-002 — new · requirements `## Client`
The client polls.
